	a) include provision for participants other than Health Boards to withdraw from section 17C arrangements if they wish to do so; 
	b) impose conditions (including conditions as to qualifications and experience) to be satisfied by  ...  dental practitioners performing personal dental services, in accordance with section 17C arrangements. In paragraph (b) “practitioner” does not include a practitioner who is undergoing training of a prescribed description. 
