	- “Regulation (EC) No. 1760/2000” means Regulation (EC) No 1760/2000 of the European Parliament and of the Council establishing a system for the identification and registration of bovine animals and regarding the labelling of beef and beef products and repealing Council Regulation (EC) No 820/97 ;
	- “secondary ear tag” means an ear tag of a model and material approved by the Scottish Ministers in accordance with Article 4 of

